  "Description": {
    "Cost": 5447689,
    "UIName": "Dyrnwyn",
    "Id": "chassisdef_dyrnwyn_DYR-E",
    "Name": "Dyrnwyn",
    "Details": "The E configuration of the Dyrnwyn OmniMech focuses on close-range firepower and electronic warfare. Each arm mounts an Improved Heavy Medium Laser, while the torso contains two iATM-3 launchers, a Light TAG and a Nova CEWS. Jump jets and the Partial Wing System carry it quickly into range, and the Dyrnwyn's Interface Cockpit, which freed weight by removing the gyro, helps it carry this varied loadout on a light chassis.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Dyrnwyn"
  },
