  "StockRole": "Striker",
  "YangsThoughts": "This one’s built to get close and make itself useful once it’s there. Those Improved Heavy Medium Lasers hit like a hammer, while the iATMs give you some flexibility before you close the distance. Throw in the Nova CEWS and Light TAG, and the rest of the lance gets to benefit from the trouble you’re causing too.",
